\centering
\small
\caption{Per-task death rates (\%) for Reflexion at $N{=}3$, 4, 5 on 10 death-prone tasks ($n{=}20$ per task). Aggregate death rates confirm stabilization at $N \geq 3$ (range: $34.0$--$36.5\%$).}
\label{tab:dose-response-detail}

